# What of frontend/ is NOT sent to the web image build (web.Dockerfile). BuildKit uses this file
# instead of any .dockerignore in frontend/, so DevOps owns it.

# Installed and built inside the image, never copied from the host
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Local env files: never baked into an image (the API URL comes in as a build arg)
**/.env*

# Logs and OS files
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
